        "I run numbers on everything, and lately the numbers on the western caravan route are bad. The Kolkar centaur have turned Kolkar Crag into a toll booth nobody agreed to, and every wagon that doesn't make it through comes straight out of my margins. I'm not sentimental about it, and I'll admit it: I want the centaur numbers down and the road profitable again, in roughly that order. Kolkar Crag is west of Razor Hill, up against the mountains, so kill the Kolkar Warriders and any other centaur you find there. Every wagon that gets through is one I don't have to explain to my cousin Gazlowe in Ratchet, and he isn't a patient goblin.",
